[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5679.03, "timestamp": "01:34:39", "text": "媽的。  啊，該死的狙擊手。  我聽不懂他在說什麼。  哦，是嗎？他媽的。他拋棄了我。這是什麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5681.669, "timestamp": "01:34:41", "text": "情況？  這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5685.83, "timestamp": "01:34:45", "text": "是什麼地圖？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5693.51, "timestamp": "01:34:53", "text": "太多了。啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5695.83, "timestamp": "01:34:55", "text": "見鬼。我不應該，我不應該"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5698.55, "timestamp": "01:34:58", "text": "這樣做。應該來的。不應該收到"}]